title: Upstairs, Downstairs
text: Two rooms upstairs with no door between them. Each laser can see its target through the wall, and the only way round is through the cellar.
trick: one bender in the cellar's east corner turns both beams: green, which went down the middle stairwell, by 135 degrees back along the cellar floor and up the same stairwell on the other diagonal; red, coming down the east stairwell, by 45 degrees towards the west stairwell
motif: rooms (a house in cross-section: two upstairs rooms, a floor with three stairwells, a cellar)
expect: merges>=1, depth>=3
---
